n该市是努瓦克肖特-乌姆图西国际机场（该国两个国际机场之一）的所在地，同时也拥有大西洋沿岸的深水港口。\n努瓦克肖特位于非洲西海岸，东临撒哈拉沙漠，西濒大西洋。","culture":"1960年代，努瓦克肖特市建立了自己的地方政府。\n努瓦克肖特的著名景点有毛里塔尼亚国家博物馆、国家图书馆和国家档案馆等。","see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q3688","articleTitle":"努瓦克肖特","sourceRevision":91074022,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 努瓦克肖特","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8A%AA%E7%93%A6%E5%85%8B%E8%82%96%E7%89%B9"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91074022"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q3688"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159150947","name":"阿塔尔","country":"MRT","lat":20.51664,"lon":-13.04999,"kind":"city","region":"MR-07","rank":3,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159150065","name":"努瓦迪布","country":"MRT","lat":20.9,"lon":-17.05602,"kind":"city","region":"MR-08","rank":4,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"努瓦迪布 · 地点概要","geo":"努瓦迪布（阿拉伯语：），1907年至1970年称艾蒂安港（法语：），毛里塔尼亚的第二大城市（仅次于首都努瓦克肖特），努瓦迪布湾省首府，位于一个名为拉斯努瓦迪布仅的长40英里的半岛上，半岛西部属西撒哈拉，努瓦迪布距离边境不足1英里。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q184184","articleTitle":"努瓦迪布","sourceRevision":82257071,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 努瓦迪布","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8A%AA%E7%93%A6%E8%BF%AA%E5%B8%83"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=82257071"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q184184"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159150069","name":"阿尤恩阿特魯斯","country":"MRT","lat":16.66659,"lon":-9.61666,"kind":"city","region":"MR-02","rank":4,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159148209","name":"圣路易","country":"MRT","lat":16.01999,"lon":-16.51001,"kind":"city","region":"MR-06","rank":6,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"圣路易 · 地点概要","geo":"该城位于塞首都达喀尔以北约300千米的塞内加尔河河口处，从1673年起作为法国殖民统治下的塞内加尔首府，1916年以后，该市成为法兰西殖民帝国本土的一部分，直至1960年独立，1920年至1957年间亦作为相邻殖民地毛里塔尼亚的首府。\n圣路易的心脏地区位于一个窄长岛屿圣路易斯岛之上，岛屿长2千米，宽400米，距塞内加尔河河口25千米，岛上特色的殖民时期建筑使它被列为世界文化遗产。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q273779","articleTitle":"圣路易 (塞内加尔)","sourceRevision":83103658,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 圣路易 (塞内加尔)","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9C%A3%E8%B7%AF%E6%98%93%20%28%E5%A1%9E%E5%86%85%E5%8A%A0%E5%B0%94%29"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=83103658"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q273779"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159148211","name":"提吉克贾","country":"MRT","lat":18.55002,"lon":-11.4166,"kind":"city","region":"MR-09","rank":6,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"提吉克贾 · 地点概要","geo":"提吉克贾是西非国家毛里塔尼亚中部的城镇，也是塔甘特省的首府，位于撒哈拉沙漠边缘，建城于1680年，海拔高度321米，该镇以棕榈树和建筑物著名，镇内有国内机场。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q757041","articleTitle":"提吉克賈","sourceRevision":76185379,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 提吉克贾","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%8F%90%E5%90%89%E5%85%8B%E8%B3%88"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=76185379"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q757041"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159148577","name":"比尔莫格兰","country":"MRT","lat":25.2333,"lon":-11.58331,"kind":"city","region":"